<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia sells 200,000/t wheat to India-AWB.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia sells 200,000/t wheat to India-AWB.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia sold 200,000 tonnes of wheat to India for March delivery, the Australian Wheat Board said in its weekly grain report.</p>
<p>&quot;This latest sale increases our total sales to India this season to around 1.3 million tonnes, more than three quarters of the total 1.7 million tonnes India is reported to have purchased this year,&quot; the AWB said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
